Scoped convolution video filter

The option table, matrix parsing, rdiv and bias resolution, identity copy,
pixel-format list, avpriv_mirror edge setup and the eight-bit square (3x3,
5x5, 7x7), row and column kernels in src/video-convolution.ts and
src/video-ops/convolution.ts follow libavfilter/vf_convolution.c
(convolution_options, pix_fmts, param_init, filter_slice, filter_3x3,
filter_5x5, filter_7x7, filter_row, filter_column, setup_5x5, setup_7x7,
setup_row, setup_column), libavfilter/convolution.h (setup_3x3) and
libavutil/internal.h (avpriv_mirror).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
